# StatusMenus: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_StatusMenus.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen IRICE-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
setup foot &
wait 2
shot bar
note find the Sound and Battery items' x (guesses below: sound 1790, battery 1730)
ptr glide 1790 15 300
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot sound-open
note the Sound menu under its item
ptr glide 1300 700 300
ptr click
wait 0.5
shot outside
note closed by a click on the desktop
ptr glide 1790 15 300
ptr click
wait 0.6
ptr glide 1730 15 200
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot switched
note one click on Battery closed Sound and opened Battery
ptr glide 600 15 200
ptr click
wait 0.5
shot empty-bar
note the empty bar strip closed it
ptr glide 1790 15 300
ptr click
ptr glide 1300 700 300
wait 4.5
shot auto-4s
note still open
wait 1
shot auto-6s
note closed after 5 s without the pointer
ptr glide 1790 15 300
ptr click
wait 3
ptr glide 1730 15 200
ptr click
ptr glide 1300 700 300
wait 4.5
shot own-timer
note Battery (opened 3 s into Sound) is still open 4.5 s after its own click
key -k Escape
wait 0.5
shot esc
note Escape closed it

look glass
setup foot &
wait 2
shot bar
note find the Sound and Battery items' x (guesses below: sound 1790, battery 1730)
ptr glide 1790 15 300
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot sound-open
note the Sound menu under its item
ptr glide 1300 700 300
ptr click
wait 0.5
shot outside
note closed by a click on the desktop
ptr glide 1790 15 300
ptr click
wait 0.6
ptr glide 1730 15 200
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot switched
note one click on Battery closed Sound and opened Battery
ptr glide 600 15 200
ptr click
wait 0.5
shot empty-bar
note the empty bar strip closed it
ptr glide 1790 15 300
ptr click
ptr glide 1300 700 300
wait 4.5
shot auto-4s
note still open
wait 1
shot auto-6s
note closed after 5 s without the pointer
ptr glide 1790 15 300
ptr click
wait 3
ptr glide 1730 15 200
ptr click
ptr glide 1300 700 300
wait 4.5
shot own-timer
note Battery (opened 3 s into Sound) is still open 4.5 s after its own click
key -k Escape
wait 0.5
shot esc
note Escape closed it
